# compiled output
/dist
/node_modules
/build

# auto-generated GraphQL schema (code-first: source of truth is the TS decorators)
# schema.gql is committed on purpose: the front generates its types from
# this versioned file, so the Netlify build needs no API and the deployed
# one can keep introspection off. The back overwrites it identically at boot.

